  <title>Colour sensor - two-board layout / USB down</title>
  <description>Confirmed electrical assignments; revised physical layout 8 September 2026. Main perfboard 50 x 70 mm, ESP32 rotated 180 degrees in component-side view, USB down. Separate 80 x 20 mm horizontal button board; original button contact orientation unchanged. New hole positions, socket registration and wire bends are provisional. Coloured wires are insulated solder-side wiring viewed through the board, not an underside photograph. Shell module and inter-board positions on this sheet are documentation only. No CAD created.</description>
  <author>Tikita</author>
